## Biography
I am a Scheduler Scientist in the Survey Scheduling Team for the Vera C. Rubin Observatory. Currently, most of my effort is focused on development of scheduler and progress visualization and monitoring tools. Previously, I developed the automated schedulers for the Dark Energy Survey and the SDSS photometric telescope. I also played other important roles in these and other projects, including survey observing operations optimization and support, development of observing operations and data processing software, preparation of data releases, and observing both in commissioning and production.
